      <body>
         <div type="letter">
            <pb xml:id="p001" facs="https://iiif.ub.unibe.ch/image/v3/schwarzenbach/letter_0300_001.tif"/>
            <milestone unit="textregion" xml:id="p001_r"/>
            <figure>
               <head resp="editor">
                  <lb xml:id="p001_l"/>Skizze von Manhattan</head>
               <bibl>
                  <persName><rs type="person" key="person_0082">Schwarzenbach, Annemarie</rs></persName>
               </bibl>
            </figure>
            <pb xml:id="p002" facs="https://iiif.ub.unibe.ch/image/v3/schwarzenbach/letter_0300_002.tif"/>
            <milestone unit="textregion" xml:id="p002_r"/>
            <p xmlns:local="local" local:warning="FML-generated-to-avoid-structural-problems">
               <lb xml:id="p002_l"/></p>
            <p>1000 Grüsse u. Wünsche, – 
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_3"/>und ich würde Dich gern einmal 
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_4"/>wiedersehen. Wen[n] ich, vielleicht Ende 
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_5"/>Februar, wieder in Sils bin?</p>
            <p xmlns:local="local" local:warning="FML-generated-to-avoid-structural-problems">
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_6"/>With Best Wishes for a 
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_7"/>Merry Christmas 
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_8"/>and a 
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_9"/>Happy New Year[vorgedruckter Text]</p>
            <p>
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_10"/>Ich sah Deinen Film hier, The Road Back, [Film erschien 1937] 
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_11"/>u. habe Dein Buch[unklar, welches gemeint ist], gelesen – das sehr, 
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_12"/>sehr schön ist. Lass es Dir gut gehen –</p>
            <p xmlns:local="local" local:warning="FML-generated-to-avoid-structural-problems">
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_13"/>Deine 
               <lb xml:id="p002_r_tl_14"/>Annemarie</p>
         </div>
      </body>
